{"id":"2165d19d1a5358d9567a9bc1308d968e082558d4","axis":"silent","repo":"payloadcms/payload","sha":"2165d19d1a5358d9567a9bc1308d968e082558d4","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/admin/react-hooks.mdx","lines":["@@ -67,7 +67,6 @@ type FieldType<T> = {","   initialValue?: T","   path: string","   permissions: FieldPermissions","-  readOnly?: boolean","   rows?: Row[]","   schemaPath: string","   setValue: (val: unknown, disableModifyingForm?: boolean) => void"],"additions":0,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/migration-guide/v4.mdx","lines":["@@ -913,6 +913,22 @@ When a missing locale is already valid for the receiving API, optional chaining"," const locale = useLocale()?.code"," ```"," ","+### `readOnly` removed from the `useField` return type","+","+The deprecated `readOnly` property has been removed from `FieldType`, the object returned by `useField`. `useField` already stopped returning it in 3.x, so it was always `undefined` at runtime.","+","+Read `readOnly` from your field component's props instead:","+","+````diff","+'use client'","+import type { TextFieldClientComponent } from 'payload'","+import { useField } from '@payloadcms/ui'","+","+-export const MyField: TextFieldClientComponent = ({ path }) => {","+-  const { readOnly, value } = useField({ path })","++export const MyField: TextFieldClientComponent = ({ path, readOnly }) => {","++  const { value } = useField({ path })","+"," ### Deprecated `TableColumnsProvider` props removed"," "," The following deprecated props have been removed from `TableColumnsProvider` and its `TableColumnsProviderProps` type:","@@ -938,7 +954,7 @@ The following deprecated props have been removed from `TableColumnsProvider` and"," >","   {children}"," </TableColumnsProvider>","-```","+````"," "," ### RichText adapter `i18n` property removed"," ","@@ -1033,6 +1049,20 @@ The codemod rewrites property reads and destructures on `initAdminContext()` res"," "," The deprecated `DiffMethod` type has been removed from `payload`. It mirrored an enum from `react-diff-viewer-continued`, which Payload no longer depends on. Remove any imports of `DiffMethod`."," ","+### `diffMethod` prop removed from Diff components","+","+Custom Diff components (`admin.components.Diff`) no longer receive a `diffMethod` prop. It has been removed from `FieldDiffClientProps` and every field-specific variant like `TextFieldDiffClientProps`. Payload always passed the same `'diffWordsWithSpace'` value, so the prop carried no information. Each Diff component handles its own diffing.","+","+Remove `diffMethod` from your props. If you passed it on to a diffing utility, pass `'diffWordsWithSpace'` directly instead:","+","+```diff","+  export const MyTextDiff: React.FC<TextFieldDiffClientProps> = ({","+-   diffMethod,","+    valueFrom,","+    valueTo,","+  }) => {","+```","+"," ### Collection `afterOperation` hook: `operation: 'read'` removed"," "," The deprecated `'read'` value for the `operation` argument of collection `afterOperation` hooks has been removed. Payload has not dispatched `afterOperation` with `operation: 'read'` for some time — the `find` and `findByID` operations report their own names (`'find'` and `'findByID'`) instead.","@@ -1142,6 +1172,15 @@ If you use a `declare module` augmentation to extend `GeneratedDatabaseSchema` ("," "," Run `npx @payloadcms/codemod --transform migrate-db-types-subpath` to migrate automatically. The codemod handles import declarations, re-export declarations, and `declare module` augmentations."," ","+### `findMigrationDir` removed from `@payloadcms/drizzle`","+","+The deprecated `findMigrationDir` re-export has been removed from `@payloadcms/drizzle`. Import it from `payload` instead:","+","+```diff","+- import { findMigrationDir } from '@payloadcms/drizzle'","++ import { findMigrationDir } from 'payload'","+```","+"," ### Minimum supported Node.js version is now 24.15.0 ([#16540](https://github.com/payloadcms/payload/pull/16540))"," "," The minimum supported Node.js version is now **24.15.0** (previously 18.20.2). Upgrade your runtime — along with any CI, Docker images, and deployment targets — to the latest node LTS version or newer before upgrading to 4.0.","@@ -1257,13 +1296,21 @@ The table feature is no longer experimental, so it drops its prefix."," "," Stored content is unaffected."," ","+### Lexical: `LexicalEditorProps` renamed to `LexicalEditorArgs`","+","+The `LexicalEditorProps` type exported from `@payloadcms/richtext-lexical` has been renamed to `LexicalEditorArgs`. It describes the arguments of the `lexicalEditor` function, not component props. The shape is unchanged.","+","+````diff","+- import type { LexicalEditorProps } from '@payloadcms/richtext-lexical'","++ import type { LexicalEditorArgs } from '@payloadcms/richtext-lexical'","+"," ### Lexical: `UploadDataImproved` replaced by `UploadData` ([#18606](https://github.com/payloadcms/payload/pull/18606))"," "," The internal `UploadDataImproved` type has been removed, and its definition is now used by the public `UploadData` type. Replace any `UploadDataImproved` imports and type references with `UploadData`:"," "," ```ts"," import type { UploadData } from '@payloadcms/richtext-lexical'","-```","+````"," "," ### Lexical: the `version` of nodes is ignored"," "],"additions":49,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"next.config.mjs","lines":["@@ -31,8 +31,6 @@ const config = withBundleAnalyzer(","       env: {","         PAYLOAD_CORE_DEV: 'true',","         ROOT_DIR: path.resolve(dirname),","-        // @todo remove in 4.0 - will behave like this by default in 4.0","-        PAYLOAD_DO_NOT_SANITIZE_LOCALIZED_PROPERTY: 'true',","       },","       async redirects() {","         return ["],"additions":0,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/db-d1-sqlite/src/index.ts","lines":["@@ -222,9 +222,6 @@ export function sqliteD1Adapter(args: Args): DatabaseAdapterObj<SQLiteD1Adapter>","   }"," }"," ","-/**","- * @todo deprecate /types subpath export in 4.0","- */"," e